  "objects": [
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-1",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 28,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "User guide · All tools",
      "fontSize": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-2",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 620,
      "zIndex": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "The toolbar defaults to icons with text. Brush and Line style are already in Favorites; customize them in toolbar settings. On first use, an editable infinite note, User guide · All tools, is added with every tool and practice objects. Pan with the middle button or Space+drag, zoom with the wheel, and use the pin list to jump to chapters. Existing examples and edited works are preserved; editing or deleting this guide does not recreate it on every launch. Clear current page is included in Common by default. Updating adds this favorite while keeping your other choices. Regular and screen canvases use the same outlined icons and nine-button shape grid. Selection and Laser remain outside all tabs. Laser is included in Common by default without a duplicate button. Click Laser again for settings.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-3",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 722,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 530,
      "zIndex": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "01 Interface and guide language · 02 Getting started · 03 Home and work library · 04 Canvas types and pages · 05 Pan, zoom and view lock · 06 Navigation and toolbars · 07 Pen and brush choices · 08 Lines, arrows, shapes and curves · 09 Selection and transformations · 10 Properties, colors and styles · 11 Text and sticky notes · 12 Eraser · 13 Ruler · 14 Compass: prepare, lock, draw · 15 Laser pointer · 16 Calculator and timer · 17 Images, screenshots and cropping · 18 View pins and colors · 19 Screen canvas · 20 Saving, data and export · 21 Keyboard reference · 22 App updates · 23 Scope and known limits · 24 Background settings in practice · 25 Layer order and editing feedback",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-4",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "01 · Interface and guide language",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-5",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1382,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 320,
      "zIndex": 4,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "At the bottom of the home sidebar, choose Language (the 文/A icon when collapsed). The ten languages are Traditional Chinese (default), Simplified Chinese, English, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, French, German, Brazilian Portuguese and Arabic. A saved choice applies immediately and is remembered at startup. Existing work names and text are not translated; new default names use the current language.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-6",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1714,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 290,
      "zIndex": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Help opens in the current interface language. The selector on this page changes only the guide, not the app preference. All guide pages, navigation and search work offline. Arabic menus and help read right to left; canvas coordinates are not mirrored. System file dialogs and original error messages may use another language; some built-in controls may require an app restart.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-7",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2072,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 6,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "02 · Getting started",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-8",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2134,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 170,
      "zIndex": 7,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "On the home page, press + to create a notebook, infinite canvas or bounded board. Enter a name and choose a background color and pattern. Use Pen to draw and Selection (V) to move or adjust objects.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-9",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2316,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 140,
      "zIndex": 8,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Auto-save is OFF by default. Use Ctrl+S to save manually; leaving a work or exiting normally also saves. Export .heiban for an editable backup.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-10",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2524,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 9,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "03 · Home and work library",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-11",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2586,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "zIndex": 10,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Click a card once to highlight it without showing batch actions. Double-click, or right-click and choose Open work, to enter. Right-click also offers favorites, rename, duplicate and move to trash. Trash retains the editable original; double-click a trashed card to restore.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-12",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2828,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 680,
      "zIndex": 11,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Use the dashed circle beside Import to enter multi-select; a checked circle identifies a selected work. Select all current results or choose individual cards, then move them to trash; Done exits multi-select. Search by name, filter by format, sort by modification, creation or name, and choose 160/190/250 pt thumbnails. Import opens .heiban or .blackboard.json; the sidebar switches between all works, favorites and trash. The toolbar defaults to icons with text. Brush and Line style are already in Favorites; customize them in toolbar settings. On first use, an editable infinite note, User guide · All tools, is added with every tool and practice objects. Pan with the middle button or Space+drag, zoom with the wheel, and use the pin list to jump to chapters. Existing examples and edited works are preserved; editing or deleting this guide does not recreate it on every launch.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-13",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3576,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 12,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "04 · Canvas types and pages",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-14",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3638,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "A notebook has independent pages. The bottom page number and previous/next arrows navigate; + adds a page. The page menu can jump, rename, duplicate, reorder or delete pages. An infinite canvas extends in any direction. A bounded board has a fixed page boundary for presentations or structured layouts.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-15",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3910,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 320,
      "zIndex": 14,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "An infinite canvas has no size selector. A new bounded board initially uses a 16:9 presentation (1920×1080); A4 portrait, A4 landscape and 1:1 remain available. Switching types remembers that dialog's chosen sizes. Creation and Canvas background offer plain, ruled, dotted, square grid and staff paper plus color. Apply changes an existing background; Cancel leaves it unchanged; one undo restores it.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-16",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4298,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 15,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "05 · Pan, zoom and view lock",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-17",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4360,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 16,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Lock view: prevent pan and zoom",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-18",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4422,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "zIndex": 17,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "The wheel zooms around the pointer; Ctrl+wheel also zooms. A horizontal wheel pans. Drag with the middle button or hold Space and drag with the left button to pan. In reading mode, left-drag pans. The zoom control offers presets, fit content and reset view.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-19",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4664,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 18,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "View lock prevents panning and wheel zoom during explanations. Both the toolbar and corner lock indicators change together. Unlock to move the view again. While holding the middle button to pan, a grabbing-hand cursor indicates that canvas dragging is active. Releasing restores the normal cursor.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-20",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4992,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 19,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "06 · Navigation and toolbars",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-21",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5054,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 20,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Dock position",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-22",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5116,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "zIndex": 21,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "The upper navigation contains Home, reading/editing mode, pins, + insertion, More, save status and a pin to keep navigation visible. Otherwise it collapses when the pointer leaves. A check marks saved work; a dashed circle means pending, saving or incomplete saving.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-23",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5358,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 22,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Drag a toolbar grip to any of the four sides: horizontal at top/bottom, vertical at left/right. More → Customize toolbar lets you show, hide and reorder tools; hidden tools remain in More tools. Object layers is a toolbar entry and a separate panel. Screen toolbar layout adapts to the available area without scrollbars.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-24",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5630,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 410,
      "zIndex": 23,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Home Settings or More → Customize toolbar offers icons only or labeled tabs: Common, Draw, Insert and Organize. Selection (V) stays available. Tools occupy one row or column; when space is short, the arrows switch tool groups without adding rows. Check the left box to show a tool and Common to choose favorites. Select all, Defaults and ordering remain available. App-owned panels and dialogs use a fixed paper-white and green HeiBan design independent of Windows light/dark mode. System file pickers remain controlled by Windows.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-25",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6052,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 620,
      "zIndex": 24,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "The toolbar defaults to icons with text. Brush and Line style are already in Favorites; customize them in toolbar settings. On first use, an editable infinite note, User guide · All tools, is added with every tool and practice objects. Pan with the middle button or Space+drag, zoom with the wheel, and use the pin list to jump to chapters. Existing examples and edited works are preserved; editing or deleting this guide does not recreate it on every launch. Clear current page is included in Common by default. Updating adds this favorite while keeping your other choices. Regular and screen canvases use the same outlined icons and nine-button shape grid. Selection and Laser remain outside all tabs. Laser is included in Common by default without a duplicate button. Click Laser again for settings.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-26",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6740,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 25,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "07 · Pen and brush choices",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-27",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6802,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 26,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Pen · Highlighter · Paint brush · Brush and object settings · Question cover tape",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-28",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6894,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 440,
      "zIndex": 27,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Choose Pen, Highlighter or a drawing tool, then Brush for color, width and opacity. Adjust the color wheel and press + in Saved colors to save it. Click a swatch to apply it; use Manage or its context menu to remove it, or Restore default colors to reset. An empty palette stays empty after restarting. Regular and screen canvases share saved colors. Only the currently selected drawing tool shows a line in its next stroke color. The brush panel has one scrolling area. The brush-type selector without material effects has been removed; old document fields are preserved.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-29",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7346,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 500,
      "zIndex": 28,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "With the vector pen, draw an approximately straight stroke and keep pressing without moving for one second to snap it straight. Moving more than 12 pt restores the original stroke preview. Releasing commits one undo operation. Cover tape in More tools hides a question; double-click or use object settings to reveal/hide it, with undo support. Pen, highlighter and paint strokes are not automatically selected or boxed when finished. Press V and select an object to move, resize or rotate it; double-click opens detailed properties. The board eraser keeps its upper-left to lower-right angle, with 20% less length and unchanged thickness.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-30",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
