    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-33",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "highlighter",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 7896,
      "width": 160,
      "height": 20,
      "zIndex": 32,
      "strokeColor": "#d9b927",
      "strokeWidth": 20,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 0.45,
      "isLocked": false,
      "points": "[{\"x\": 710, \"y\": 7906}, {\"x\": 850, \"y\": 7906}]"
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-34",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8154,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 33,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "08 · Lines, arrows, shapes and curves",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-35",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8216,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 34,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Shapes · Curve · Magnet",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-36",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8278,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 35,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Create a line or arrow by dragging, or clicking A then B. Move the shaft or adjust endpoints independently. In Properties, choose a segment, extend toward A or B, or extend both ways without changing the original endpoints. Arrow head length and width are separate controls; stroke thickness also changes the head outline.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-37",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8550,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 290,
      "zIndex": 36,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Drag rectangles, circles, diamonds, pentagons and stars. Triangles and quadrilaterals use successive points. A curve uses three points: first starts the preview, second fixes the bend, third commits. Selection edits vertices or control points. Esc cancels unfinished geometry. Color and Properties control applicable stroke, fill, gradient and opacity.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-38",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8852,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 770,
      "zIndex": 37,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Drawing tools remain active after creation. Triangles and quadrilaterals preview straight segments; only Curve previews a curve. Circles, diamonds, pentagons and stars are dragged from their center, rectangles from a corner. Magnet works from the first point, with a green ring within about 10 screen DIPs. A rectangle has nine references: four corners, four edge midpoints and center. Triangles have three vertices and three midpoints; other polygons also include edge midpoints, and lines/arrows include both ends and midpoint. Circles and compass arcs provide center and four cardinal points; arcs also provide endpoints. Hidden objects are excluded, locked shapes remain references, and existing objects never move. Magnet snaps geometric construction points and compass positioning only. Pen, highlighter and paintbrush preserve the freehand path when crossing existing strokes, in both regular and screen canvases. Ruler projection and the one-second hold-to-straighten feature still follow their own rules.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-39",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 9658,
      "width": 170,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 38,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "#dcebdd",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-40",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "circle",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 9658,
      "width": 110,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 39,
      "strokeColor": "#4189c7",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-41",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "triangle",
      "x": 474,
      "y": 9658,
      "width": 160,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 40,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "#fff0ab",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "points": "[{\"x\": 554, \"y\": 9658}, {\"x\": 474, \"y\": 9768}, {\"x\": 634, \"y\": 9768}]"
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-42",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 690,
      "y": 9658,
      "width": 150,
      "height": 100,
      "zIndex": 41,
      "strokeColor": "#ba652b",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "x1": 690,
      "y1": 9758,
      "x2": 840,
      "y2": 9658
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-43",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9900,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 42,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "09 · Selection and transformations",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-44",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9962,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 43,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Select · Lasso selection",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-45",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10024,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 44,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Use V to select. Ctrl+click toggles objects; lasso selects an enclosed region. Drag a box left to right to select only fully enclosed objects (blue solid border), or right to left to select touched objects (green dashed border). Ctrl/Shift-drag adds selection. Multiple objects can move, copy, paste, change style or delete together.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-46",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10296,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 320,
      "zIndex": 45,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "A single shape has eight resize handles and a rotation handle; the pointer shows the corresponding direction or rotation arrow. Lines/arrows have A/B handles and arcs have start/end handles. Image corners preserve proportions by default; Shift allows free resizing. Shift while rotating snaps to 15°. Locked objects are excluded from batch move/delete; hidden objects stay in the layer panel.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-47",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10628,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "zIndex": 46,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Creating or single-clicking an object shows only resize, rotation or endpoint handles. Detailed controls appear on double-click; double-clicking text starts editing. Choose V to manipulate an object and another tool to resume drawing. Drawing tools do not return to V after each object.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-48",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10926,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 47,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "10 · Properties, colors and styles",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-49",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10988,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 48,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Line style · Extend line",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-50",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11050,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 290,
      "zIndex": 49,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "The Properties panel shows only settings applicable to the selected object. Adjust stroke color, thickness, applicable fill/gradient/opacity, text or geometry values. Solid, dashed, dotted and dash-dot choices show line samples; the toolbar reflects the current style. Drawing defaults can be set before drawing; selected-object changes also update subsequent drawing settings.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-51",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11352,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 50,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Dock the panel by its Dock control or drag its title to an edge: vertical at left/right, horizontal at top/bottom. Layers, eraser and ruler settings have their own entries instead of cluttering an unrelated object's properties. Line extension and arrow head dimensions are in the line/arrow properties.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-52",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11680,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 51,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "11 · Text and sticky notes",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-53",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11742,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 52,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Text · Sticky note",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-54",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11804,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 290,
      "zIndex": 53,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Choose Text (T) or Sticky note, then click the canvas and type. Enter inserts a line break; Ctrl+Enter or leaving the editor finishes; Esc cancels. Composition input does not trigger tool shortcuts. The color circle provides font, bold, italic, underline, strike-through and alignment. Sticky notes have folded-corner, tape, cat, notebook, grid and soft styles.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-55",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12106,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 290,
      "zIndex": 54,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Edit partial text formatting opens an editor: select text, then apply format, text color or highlight and save as one undo operation. Right-click text or its draft for whole-box style. More text settings applies only changed fields to unlocked text/notes on the current page, skipping other objects. Screen text supports 8–144 pt, custom #RRGGBB, font, alignment and opacity.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-56",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12464,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 55,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "12 · Eraser",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-57",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12526,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 56,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Eraser",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-58",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12588,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 170,
      "zIndex": 57,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Select Eraser; click it again to choose object erasing or partial stroke erasing and adjust diameter. A translucent circle previews its range in both the regular and screen canvas.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-59",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12770,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 200,
      "zIndex": 58,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Object erasing removes an entire touched stroke or geometric object. Partial stroke erasing removes only the crossed part of a stroke. Text, sticky notes and images are protected; select them and press Delete to remove them.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-en-60",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12982,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 800,
      "zIndex": 59,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "The regular canvas has an original paper-white and sage magnetic eraser viewed straight from above at bottom right. Drag it to erase the matching angled, rounded felt footprint; releasing returns it to its dock and commits one undoable action. Esc or lost pointer capture cancels the whole wipe. Right-click to choose object or partial-stroke mode, or hide it. Home Settings → Show board eraser restores it. Its screen size is converted into document coordinates at the current zoom. Partial/pixel mode cuts ink only; it does not alter image pixels or original PDF/presentation elements. The screen canvas keeps its circular toolbar eraser. Use toolbar More → Show board eraser to toggle it and remember the choice. The eraser slopes from upper left to lower right; grabbing and erasing follow the mirrored outline. Drag the circular eraser continuously. The preview updates progressively; releasing finishes the gesture as one undoable action. Esc or interrupted pointer capture cancels an unfinished gesture. Normal saving or exit waits for a released erasing gesture to finish.",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
